# Unreal
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.sln
*.suo
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/

# Headless core build
build/
Tools/HeadlessBuild/build/
match.json
*.rep

!Build/
Build/*
!Build/Compliance/
